{
  "description": "The names the compose file reads (`${NAME}`, `${NAME:-}`, `${NAME:-default}` in containers) for the selected environment: whether each is set in iii cloud, secret or variable, and where its value can come from (a .env file of the person's folder, the environment's address, a copy from another environment). Names, file names and flags only: never a secret's value. manifest: another worker-compose*.yaml; from: checkout reads the person's folder.",
  "function_id": "iii-cloud::values",
